// 1.5: the off-hand fist (RSQ_Hands, the off hand's own weapon) in slot 1, so the OFF hand can be
// switched back to the fist after a gun was moved there (slot 1 for the off hand). It can never be
// selected into the main hand: it is an off-hand weapon and cannot change hands.
weaponsection "Brutal_Doom"
addslotdefault 1 RSQ_Hands

// 1.97: the Machinegun on slot 4 with the MG42 (BD22 KEYCONF setslot 4 ... MG42)
addslot 4 Machinegun
